{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "a5fbe295-0e13-4589-9191-1304f33dc1ae"/*_RenderCubeMapFaces*/,
  "Description": "Evaluates the connected command once per cube map face, with a camera whose rows are the face's right, down and forward directions.\n\nOnly shaders that build their rays from that camera fill the faces correctly. Used inside [RaymarchToCubeMap].",
